{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/0adcfd0e432a597909525b59cb23e233.gif?t=1768316972\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/0adcfd0e432a597909525b59cb23e233.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>People have hobbies, and you turn them into inventory.</strong> In Scar City, the moment you show up, shelves empty faster and the fun gets pricier. In <i>Scalpers\u2019 Spoils</i>\u00a0you are the scalper. Sprint through crowds, snatch products by the dozen, beat the fans on online drops, hoard hype, and flip the haul for profit. Play solo or with up to three friends and prove that people\u2019s passion is your margin.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/bb5d5dedc2b113620d485684d1176863.gif?t=1768316972\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/bb5d5dedc2b113620d485684d1176863.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/d4bb84e7043cabc348d37428f50d8755.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/d4bb84e7043cabc348d37428f50d8755.webm?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/d4bb84e7043cabc348d37428f50d8755.mp4?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At every <strong>restock</strong> you race a crowd to the same shelf. Grab fast, stack as many items as you can, and keep moving as the aisle gets crowded and messy, because everyone is trying to do the same. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online the race is against the clock: stock goes down every second, pop-ups get in your way, and captchas make you prove you are human. Close them, load the cart, and check out before it sells out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/2546c759f64e7546e63ecba595c63cbd.gif?t=1768316972\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/2546c759f64e7546e63ecba595c63cbd.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/c9bdc7372c15c0a1a94eb4999f9b342e.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/c9bdc7372c15c0a1a94eb4999f9b342e.webm?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/c9bdc7372c15c0a1a94eb4999f9b342e.mp4?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Congrats!</strong> You scalped! Now it\u2019s time to put items on your shelves or list them from your phone. In your store, greet a buyer, show the item, set a price, and haggle a little. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online is a bit different: offers arrive in your messages. Accept, counter, or wait. Pick a meetup time, deliver the item, and get paid. Check price history and trends before you decide. A short wait can mean a bigger margin. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert at meetups and walk away if something feels a bit <i>fishy! Nobody said scalping is a safe &quot;profession&quot;!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/9e4c3c0108feeebd3e87f34a5fe866f3.gif?t=1768316972\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/9e4c3c0108feeebd3e87f34a5fe866f3.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/a3b51d6e470835e776fff4d0c60ba407.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/a3b51d6e470835e776fff4d0c60ba407.webm?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/a3b51d6e470835e776fff4d0c60ba407.mp4?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small and build a real shop. Add shelves and display cases. Set up a back room with storage. Create a simple office for listings and price tracking. Install PC stations for online releases. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire a crew to help with queuing, carrying, and deliveries. Upgrade tools that save seconds, because seconds change the price.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/94166e2dc3dac24c7239bae4903969c2.gif?t=1768316972\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/94166e2dc3dac24c7239bae4903969c2.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/7cd97af33a288c40c8bc3e3b118a597b.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/7cd97af33a288c40c8bc3e3b118a597b.webm?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/7cd97af33a288c40c8bc3e3b118a597b.mp4?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sealed pack or blind box is a decision. Keep it sealed for a safe flip or open it for a chance at a rare. Use the pack station to open many at once. Complete a full set and sell it as a premium bundle. Sometimes you win big. Sometimes you pull bulk. Choose how much risk you want to take.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/3665655eda40910ba27af51e5ce8a90e.gif?t=1768316972\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/3665655eda40910ba27af51e5ce8a90e.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/78be4734af3938be622776d58e68b489.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/78be4734af3938be622776d58e68b489.webm?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/78be4734af3938be622776d58e68b489.mp4?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to four players online. Share a store, plan your route, and split roles. One runs to the shelf, one holds the cart, one handles the phone, one does delivery, or swap as needed. Communicate, carry more, and clear the aisle faster than the rest of the city.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Satirical first-person scalper sim</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Chaotic drop events </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Online drop mini-games </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Risk and reward economy: sealed vs opened, batch processing, set bonuses, price swings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Store management, haggling, hoarding,  restocking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Phone hub: Map, Messages, Listings with price history, Bank, Hype, Crew</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Co-op up to 4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Open World, Sandbox progression  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/298b5e9617fc8b177ced168260e8d33a.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/298b5e9617fc8b177ced168260e8d33a.webm?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/298b5e9617fc8b177ced168260e8d33a.mp4?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Want first dibs when the next drop hits? Add to your wishlist for updates. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/0357e0c2ab92d98c58f9ca5ade9e0410.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/0357e0c2ab92d98c58f9ca5ade9e0410.webm?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949440?t=1768316972","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/18d09453a6809c944af85ffcb984a4df7efe262f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768316972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/5a6d9382d9682a21a27de3613eca08f6a49ab01f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768316972","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/5a6d9382d9682a21a27de3613eca08f6a49ab01f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768316972","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{