440/extras/d4bb84e7043cabc348d37428f50d8755.mp4?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At every <strong>restock</strong> you race a crowd to the same shelf. Grab fast, stack as many items as you can, and keep moving as the aisle gets crowded and messy, because everyone is trying to do the same. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online the race is against the clock: stock goes down every second, pop-ups get in your way, and captchas make you prove you are human. Close them, load the cart, and check out before it sells out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/2546c759f64e7546e63ecba595c63cbd.gif?t=1768316972\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/2546c759f64e7546e63ecba595c63cbd.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/c9bdc7372c15c0a1a94eb4999f9b342e.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/c9bdc7372c15c0a1a94eb4999f9b342e.webm?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/c9bdc7372c15c0a1a94eb4999f9b342e.mp4?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Congrats!</strong> You scalped! Now it\u2019s time to put items on your shelves or list them from your phone. In your store, greet a buyer, show the item, set a price, and haggle a little. </p></li><li><p clas