" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/94166e2dc3dac24c7239bae4903969c2.gif?t=1768316972\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/94166e2dc3dac24c7239bae4903969c2.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/7cd97af33a288c40c8bc3e3b118a597b.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/7cd97af33a288c40c8bc3e3b118a597b.webm?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/7cd97af33a288c40c8bc3e3b118a597b.mp4?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sealed pack or blind box is a decision. Keep it sealed for a safe flip or open it for a chance at a rare. Use the pack station to open many at once. Complete a full set and sell it as a premium bundle. Sometimes you win big. Sometimes you pull bulk. Choose how much risk you want to take.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/3665655eda40910ba27af51e5ce8a90e.gif?t=1768316972\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/3665655eda40910ba27af51e5ce8a90e.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/78be4734af3938be622776d58e68b489.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/78be4734af3938be622776d58e68b489.webm?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/78be4734af3938be622776d58e68b489.mp4?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to four players online. Share a store, plan your route, and split roles. One runs to the shelf, one holds the cart, one handles the phone, one does delivery, or swap as needed. Communicate, carry more, and clear the aisle faster than the rest of the city.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Satirical first-person scalper sim</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Chaotic drop events </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Online drop mini-games </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Risk and reward economy: sealed vs opened, batch processing, set bonuses, price swings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Store management, haggling, hoarding,  restocking</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Phone hub: Map, Messages, Listings with price history, Bank, Hype, Crew</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Co-op up to 4 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Open World, Sandbox progression  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/298b5e9617fc8b177ced168260e8d33a.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/298b5e9617fc8b177ced168260e8d33a.webm?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/298b5e9617fc8b177ced168260e8d33a.mp4?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Want first dibs when the next drop hits? Add to your wishlist for updates. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/0357e0c2ab92d98c58f9ca5ade9e0410.poster.avif?t=1768316972\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/extras/0357e0c2ab92d98c58f9ca5ade9e0410.webm?t=1768316972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2>","developers":["Parodie Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949440/b090876cc3c07c3ab2afcd872ac3e8e75aa8b804/header.jpg?t=1768316972","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15 Catalina<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mo